             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>The projects root as the emulated Amiga sees it, e.g. Work:Projekte (an Amiga path, not a Windows path) - needed to start programs in the emulator. Usually leave it empty: AmigaED works it out from the folder drives of your emulator configuration (Emulator tab, OS 3.x).</string>
